cameraraw.library/CameraRaw_GetLens           cameraraw.library/CameraRaw_GetLens

   NAME
        CameraRaw_GetLens -- Query lens descriptor name.

   SYNOPSIS
        lensName = CameraRaw_GetLens(handle);
        const char *CameraRaw_GetLens(APTR);

   FUNCTION
        Queries the metadata to return the camera lens descriptor name string.

   INPUTS
        handle - The CameraRaw context pointer.

   RESULT
        lensName - Pointer to the lens name string, or empty string.

   SEE ALSO
        CameraRaw_GetFocalLength()

cameraraw.library/CameraRaw_GetTimestamp cameraraw.library/CameraRaw_GetTimestamp

   NAME
        CameraRaw_GetTimestamp -- Query image capture date/time.

   SYNOPSIS
        timestamp = CameraRaw_GetTimestamp(handle);
        uint32 CameraRaw_GetTimestamp(APTR);

   FUNCTION
        Queries the image metadata to retrieve the capture time represented as
        a standard 32-bit UNIX epoch timestamp.

   INPUTS
        handle - The CameraRaw context pointer.

   RESULT
        timestamp - UNIX timestamp as 32-bit unsigned integer, or 0 on error.

   SEE ALSO
        CameraRaw_GetMake(), CameraRaw_GetModel()
